      "text": "Frontend\n\nhandle Auth:\nPOST: /sign-up/email\nPOST: /sign-in/email\nPOST: /sign-out\nPOST: /request-password-reset\nPOST: /reset-password\nPOST: /update password\n\nhandle chat:\nGET: /chats (list all chats under a user)\nGet: /chats/:id (list all the content of that chat)\n\nhandle document:\nPOST: /upload\n\nhandle actions:\nGET: /summary\nGET: /audio?question_id?=string(no question_id=chat_summary)\nGET: /change_language?language=en(default english)\nGET: /answer/:question_id\nPOST: /question\nGET: /transcribe?language=en(default english)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Frontend\n\nhandle Auth:\nPOST: /sign-up/email\nPOST: /sign-in/email\nPOST: /sign-out\nPOST: /request-password-reset\nPOST: /reset-password\nPOST: /update password\n\nhandle chat:\nGET: /chats (list all chats under a user)\nGet: /chats/:id (list all the content of that chat)\n\nhandle document:\nPOST: /upload\n\nhandle actions:\nGET: /summary\nGET: /audio?question_id?=string(no question_id=chat_summary)\nGET: /change_language?language=en(default english)\nGET: /answer/:question_id\nPOST: /question\nGET: /transcribe?language=en(default english)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "k3AYiwGD-zt4fIt45l_WD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1331.417578302605,
      "y": 659.3943229800826,
      "width": 731.4365844726562,
      "height": 594.771634615385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zXnOb3Rw1MH26BNwCiIce"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2035932655,
      "version": 1347,
      "versionNonce": 1522495070,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760206533801,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Internal\n\nocr server\nPOST: /images (ocr)(images->text,with added metadata)\n\ngeneral-docs server\nPOST: /general-docs (extractor)(general-docs->text with added metadata)\n\nwhisper server\nPOST: /audio-video (whisper)(audio/video->text with added metadata)\nPOST: /tts (text->audio)\nPOST: /language? language=en(default english) \n\nhandle summary and qna by mistral-7b-instruction\nPOST: /summary (text-> summary-> store in db)\nPOST: /question (text-> answer-> store in db)\n\nhandle dbstoring\nPOST: /text-spliter(text-> embedding -> storing(vector), storing in pg\n, add to summary queue)\n \nhandle db\nExposes all the db endpoints\n",
      "fontSize": 19.825721153846168,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Internal\n\nocr server\nPOST: /images (ocr)(images->text,with added metadata)\n\ngeneral-docs server\nPOST: /general-docs (extractor)(general-docs->text with added metadata)\n\nwhisper server\nPOST: /audio-video (whisper)(audio/video->text with added metadata)\nPOST: /tts (text->audio)\nPOST: /language? language=en(default english) \n\nhandle summary and qna by mistral-7b-instruction\nPOST: /summary (text-> summary-> store in db)\nPOST: /question (text-> answer-> store in db)\n\nhandle dbstoring\nPOST: /text-spliter(text-> embedding -> storing(vector), storing in pg\n, add to summary queue)\n \nhandle db\nExposes all the db endpoints\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
